</Footnote></Footnotes><Commentaries><Commentary Type="I" id="key-a1"><Para><Text>Art. 3  in force at 23.3.2026, see <CitationSubRef id="nd3b1f5652ff3abce" SectionRef="article-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1/1" Operative="true">art. 1(1)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a2" Type="F"><Para><Text>Words in art. 3 substituted (15.6.2026) by <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555" id="c9veat9y6-00007" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2026" Number="555" Title="The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Amendment) Order 2026">The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Amendment) Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/555)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="c9veat9y6-00007" id="c9veat9y6-00008" SectionRef="article-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/1/1">arts. 1(1)</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="c9veat9y6-00007" id="c9veat9y6-00009" SectionRef="article-2-3" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/3" Operative="true">2(3)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary></Commentaries></Legislation>